ingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/e/ef/Stage_Flooded_Caves_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073202\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Depths\" title=\"Depths\"><img alt=\"Stage Depths icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Depths icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Depths_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/7/7b/Stage_Depths_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073002\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necropolis\" title=\"Necropolis\"><img alt=\"Stage Necropolis icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Necropolis icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Necropolis_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/2/2d/Stage_Necropolis_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073022\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dank_Depths\" title=\"Dank Depths\"><img alt=\"Stage Dank Depths icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Dank Depths icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Dank_Depths_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/0/04/Stage_Dank_Depths_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073222\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sheol\" title=\"Sheol\"><img alt=\"Stage Sheol icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Sheol icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Sheol_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/7/71/Stage_Sheol_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073042\" /></a></span></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><div class=\"context-box\"><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-14\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Afterbirth\"><img alt=\"(except in Rebirth)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc a indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_a_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/9/95/Dlc_a_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20220122155526\" /></span></span> </div>\n<p><b>Fat Bats</b> move slower than a One Tooth but have more health. Fat Bats try to align themselves diagonally to Isaac, giving them a tendency to avoid his shots. They will try to shoot at Isaac once they are diagonally aligned.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/0/0c/Fat_Bat_Concept.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20181206223106\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Concept for Fat Bat.\"><img alt=\"Concept for Fat Bat.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"58\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Fat Bat Concept.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Fat_Bat_Concept.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/0/0c/Fat_Bat_Concept.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/58?cb=20181206223106\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"> Concept for Fat Bat.</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Fat Bats were first revealed for the Afterbirth DLC in a <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20150730165956/http://bindingofisaac.com/post/118734743319/monstro-mash-afterbirth-update-6\">Binding of Isaac official website post</a>.</li></ul>\n<p><br class=\"content-filter-end\" /></p><div class=\"nav-start\" style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n<table class=\"nav-box nav-main\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"nav-title\"><span class=\"no-alt\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"SmallIsaac\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-image-key=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/a6/SmallIsaac.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821194340\" /></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Binding_of_Isaac:_Rebirth_Wiki\" title=\"Binding of Isaac: Rebirth Wiki\">The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth</a><span class=\"no-alt\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"SmallIsaac\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-image-key=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a